% Bibliography for pspr.
%
% Every entry has an `annote` field describing why the work is relevant, where
% it is used in this repository, and any citation caveats. Entries are grouped
% by topic; the grouping is only a comment, the file is a single BibTeX
% database.
%
% Quick index:
%   Planning languages/formalism ... holler2020hddl, mcdermott1998pddl,
%                                   erol1994umcp, erol1996complexity,
%                                   ghallab2004automated
%   Planning algorithms .......... helmert2006fastdownward, hoffmann2001ff,
%                                   bonet2001planning, hsu2006sgplan,
%                                   nau2003shop2, alford2009translating,
%                                   behnke2019bringing, korf1985macro
%   Clustering ................... gilpin2013hierarchical, braun2023bisbm,
%                                   vonluxburg2007spectral,
%                                   arthur2007kmeanspp, hakimi1965optimum
%   Numerical optimization ....... kingma2015adam, achterberg2009scip,
%                                   hojny2025scipsuite
%   Algorithms/utilities ......... tarjan1972depth, steele2014splitmix
%   Software and data ............ yousefi2025hddlparser, sleath2023detecting,
%                                   holler2021panda, behnke2020grounding,
%                                   goodlp, ipc2023domains

